The '''Haunted Shipwreck''' is a [[Sea Events|Sea Event]].

==Spawning==
The Haunted Shipwreck may only spawn if the player is sailing a [[Boats|Boat]] in [[Sea Danger Level]] 6 '''<font color="8c00ff">(????)</font>'''. This island will despawn:
* 15 minutes after spawning.
* If there are no players near it.
** There is no cooldown for it to respawn.

Diamond, Gold, Silver and Fragment [[chests]] can be found throughout the Haunted Shipwreck. The chests inside the shipwreck are unlocked by defeating the enemies from the [[Ghost Ship Raid]].

==Enemies==
The enemies in this area are the [[Ghost Ship Raid|Ghost Ship]], [[Haunted Crew Member]]s, and [[Ghost Shark]]s. 

During the event, a [[Boats|ship]] that attacks similarly to those found in [[Ship Raid]]s will spawn. This ship has an aquamarine glow and 90,000 health, which is much more than that of the main ship in regular [[Ship Raid]]s.

==Trivia==
* The Haunted Shipwreck's [[Soundtracks|soundtrack]] is as same as the [[Graveyard Island]].
* In rare cases, two Haunted Shipwrecks can spawn at once.

